scene: The draft comes back at six with one line struck through twice: the sentence that admits the plan has failed and says what comes next. In the margin {boss} has written two words: not this.
scene W: The line is true, and the people listening deserve to hear it from the one who made the promise. {N} wrote it as a duty, not a flourish.
