- R | leak the struck line to a journalist friend, because it deserves to be heard | v: stimulation, universalism | mark: broke your word | closed: approval: a leader's private draft handed to the press; backfire: the leak is traced to the only copy, and the job goes with it | self_control: - | tribal: teach the refused words to a singer, so they reach the fires anyway | magic: slip the struck line to a broadsheet writer, so it reaches the taverns anyway | chance: 85
