scene G: The candidate grew up in the same town and knows {Ns} family. The handshake feels like the town itself saying thanks.
- W | thank the candidate, and offer to help again at the next election | v: conformity, benevolence | binds | chance: 75
- U | write down what worked this campaign, door by door, for next time | v: achievement | habit | mark: learned a skill | tribal: go over in your head what worked at each hearth, for next time | magic: write down what worked this campaign, lane by lane, for next time | chance: 95
- B | ask the candidate for a paid job on the next campaign | v: achievement, power | door | aims: campaign organiser | tribal: ask the speaker to keep you at his fire through the next gathering, fed for your walking | magic: ask the candidate for a paid place among the faction's runners next season | chance: 40
