- G>R | take both to the cafe, and let them have it out as friends | v: benevolence, tradition | tribal: sit both at your hearth through the night, and let them have it out | magic: take both to the tavern, and let them have it out over a cup | chance: 55
works: The branch chooses, and the loser shakes hands and offers to run the campaign.
works: Both stay in the branch, and the seat is fought with the whole team behind it.
fails: The loser walks out of the meeting and out of the party, and takes friends along.
